{{!-- The media block on an event, club or player page. Receives an
      EntityMediaBlock: the newest items carrying the page's hashtag, through the
      shared gallery tile, then the button to the whole gallery. The caller
      renders it only when media exists and supplies the heading in its own
      section system. --}}
<ul class="gallery-grid">
  {{#each items}}
    {{> _gallery-tile this}}
  {{/each}}
</ul>
<p class="mt-4"><a href="{{galleryHref}}" class="btn btn-outline">{{buttonLabel}}</a></p>
